@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Load the world, building and warming up, as built in slice 16.2
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Rider" as actor
box "Frontend — Ride app (ride application)" #E0F2FE
  participant "ClassRidePage" as page
  participant "WorldLoadStore" as store
  participant "startStepping" as ladder
end box
box "Frontend — Ride app (world library, lazy chunk)" #E0F2FE
  participant "WorldRenderer\n(main's, with the batched build)" as renderer
  participant "three\nWebGPURenderer" as three
end box
store -> store : the download is done (slice 16.1); the slow timer has run since World loading opened
store -> ladder : startStepping(startTier(), attempt)
ladder -> renderer : start(unseen canvas, world, nextFrame, segments, { tier, progress })
renderer -> renderer : build the scene at the tier (main's buildScene, applyTier)
renderer -> three : compileAsync(scene, camera, onProgress) through the scene pass's target and MRT
loop three compiles in batches, yielding to each frame
  three --> renderer : loaded of total
  renderer --> store : { step: 'shaders', built, total }
  store -> page : "41 of 64 programs for WebGPU" (L2-152 AC4)
end
renderer --> store : { step: 'warm-up', tier }
renderer -> renderer : main's warm-up and rehearsal, each frame awaited through nextFrame
renderer --> store : { step: 'warmed', fps, tier }
store -> page : "Holding 60 fps at Low" (L2-152 AC5)
alt A program fails to build at the tier
  renderer --> ladder : start rejects
  ladder -> renderer : dispose; a new renderer at the tier below (L2-156 AC3)
  ladder --> store : below Low: the panorama
else Started
  ladder --> store : started at the tier
  store -> page : "… is ready", Start riding takes focus
end
group 20 seconds without the world being ready (L2-155 AC1)
  store -> page : "This is taking longer than usual.", "· 24 s" on the shader step
  actor -> page : Start at Low quality (AC3)
  page -> store : startAtLow(): the warning goes; a build above Low starts again at Low
  actor -> page : Ride with the panorama (AC4)
  page -> store : ride(): the build stops, the renderer is disposed, the class ride opens
end
@enduml
